    "A similar analysis can be performed for a trapped system, where we now consider the two components a and b in identical and spatially separated harmonic traps.",
    "In particular equation  of  is very similar to (72) except that in  of  we have N \u03c7 instead of \u03c1g in (72).",
    "Another difference is that the more general equation  in  that includes two and three-body losses besides one-body losses, is derived performing an approximation on the effective Hamiltonian: the constant loss rate approximation [25]"
